{#
  One step of the journey (Booking\BookingMilestone), on the scout-year
  page's timeline pattern (`step-list` / `step-item` / `step-circle`,
  app.css): a numbered disc, a connecting line, the label, what the step
  asks, the derived sentence, and — by its nature (issue #462, D6) — a
  button, a box to tick, or nothing at all.

  **The numbered disc is the control for completing a step by hand**
  (#708, IT-14). Any step still to do can be marked done there, after an
  explicit confirmation — things happen away from the site, a contract
  accepted by e-mail, a deposit paid in cash — and a step marked by hand
  reopens the same way. A step the site completed itself does not reopen;
  « Demande reçue » and « Dates bloquées » have an inert disc; the disc of
  « Réservation confirmée » and « Location clôturée » runs the transition
  itself, with its usual confirmation. Every actionable disc is a real
  button, a 44 px target, with a name that says what it does.

  **A stretch the booking has not reached is inert** (`future`): its steps
  are visible, never actionable — no button, a disabled box.

  The visually-hidden « Fait : » / « À faire : » / « Sans objet : » prefix
  is the textual form of the disc, which is aria-hidden: a screen reader
  and the end-to-end suite read the same words.

  The whole list of one stretch, `ol` included, rather than one `li`
  rendered into a list the caller opens: a list item outside its list is
  invalid markup in the file that holds it.

  Requires `phase` (a Booking\JourneyPhase), `next_key` (the key of the
  step heading the journey, or null), `asset`, `booking`, `booking_url`,
  `renter_decisions` and `contract_step` (#708, IT-16).
#}
<ol class="list-unstyled step-list mb-0">
{% for milestone in phase.milestones %}
{% set number = loop.index %}
{% set future = phase.isFuture %}
{% set is_next = next_key is not null and next_key == milestone.key %}
{# A state (« Dates bloquées », #708 IT-01) is never a step to do: ticked
   while it holds, a warning once it no longer does. #}
{% set state = not milestone.isApplicable ? 'na' : (milestone.isDone ? 'done' : (milestone.isState ? 'warning' : 'todo')) %}
<li class="step-item d-flex gap-3 pb-3 {{ state == 'done' ? 'step-item--done' : (future or state == 'na' or state == 'warning' ? 'step-item--upcoming' : 'step-item--current') }}"
    data-milestone="{{ milestone.key }}" data-kind="{{ milestone.kind.value }}">
    <div class="step-item__marker flex-shrink-0">
        {% set disc %}
            <span class="step-circle {{ state == 'done' ? 'step-circle--done' : 'step-circle--pending' }}" aria-hidden="true">
                {% if state == 'done' %}
                    <i class="bi bi-check-lg"></i>
                {% elseif state == 'warning' %}
                    <i class="bi bi-exclamation-lg"></i>
                {% elseif state == 'na' %}
                    <i class="bi bi-dash"></i>
                {% else %}
                    {{ number }}
                {% endif %}
            </span>
        {% endset %}
        {% set can_tick = not future and milestone.canBeCompletedByHand %}
        {% set can_reopen = not future and milestone.canBeReopened %}
        {% set runs_transition = not future and state == 'todo' and milestone.key in ['confirmed', 'closed']
            and milestone.action and milestone.action.transition %}
        {% if can_tick or can_reopen %}
            <form method="post" action="/mes-locations/etape" class="d-inline" data-step-disc
                  data-confirm="{{ can_tick
                      ? 'Marquer « ' ~ milestone.label ~ ' » comme fait sans que le site ait pu le vérifier ? À ne faire que si c\'est réglé ailleurs — par e-mail, en liquide… Le site ne le vérifiera plus.'
                      : 'Rouvrir « ' ~ milestone.label ~ ' » ? L\'étape redeviendra à faire.' }}"
                  data-confirm-label="{{ can_tick ? 'Marquer comme fait' : 'Rouvrir' }}">
                {{ csrf_field()|raw }}
                <input type="hidden" name="asset_id" value="{{ asset.id }}">
                <input type="hidden" name="booking_id" value="{{ booking.id }}">
                <input type="hidden" name="milestone_key" value="{{ milestone.key }}">
                <input type="hidden" name="done" value="{{ can_tick ? '1' : '0' }}">
                {% set disc_name = can_tick
                    ? 'Marquer « ' ~ milestone.label ~ ' » comme fait'
                    : 'Rouvrir « ' ~ milestone.label ~ ' »' %}
                {# The name is the button's own text, hidden but read, rather
                   than an aria-label the visible disc would not contain. #}
                <button type="submit" class="step-disc-button" title="{{ disc_name }}">
                    {{ disc }}<span class="visually-hidden">{{ disc_name }}</span>
                </button>
            </form>
        {% elseif runs_transition %}
            {# A status, not a fact to tick: the disc runs the transition,
               with the same confirmation as its button. #}
            {% set decision = renter_decisions[milestone.action.transition.value]|default(null) %}
            <form method="post" action="/mes-locations/statut" class="d-inline" data-step-disc
                  {% if decision %}
                      data-confirm="{{ decision.question }}"
                      data-confirm-label="{{ milestone.action.label }}"
                      data-confirm-note="{{ decision.note_label }}"
                      data-confirm-note-name="message"
                  {% else %}
                      data-confirm="{{ milestone.action.label }} ?"
                      data-confirm-label="{{ milestone.action.label }}"
                  {% endif %}>
                {{ csrf_field()|raw }}
                <input type="hidden" name="asset_id" value="{{ asset.id }}">
                <input type="hidden" name="booking_id" value="{{ booking.id }}">
                <input type="hidden" name="status" value="{{ milestone.action.transition.value }}">
                <button type="submit" class="step-disc-button" title="{{ milestone.action.label }}">
                    {{ disc }}<span class="visually-hidden">{{ milestone.action.label }}</span>
                </button>
            </form>
        {% else %}
            {{ disc }}
        {% endif %}
    </div>
    <div class="flex-grow-1 {{ state == 'na' ? 'text-body-secondary opacity-50' : '' }}">
        <div class="d-flex flex-wrap align-items-baseline gap-2">
            <span class="visually-hidden">{{ state == 'done' ? 'Fait :' : (state == 'na' ? 'Sans objet :' : (state == 'warning' ? 'Attention :' : 'À faire :')) }}</span>
            <span class="fw-semibold {{ state == 'done' ? 'text-success-emphasis' : '' }}">{{ milestone.label }}</span>
            {% if state == 'todo' %}
                {% set kind_class = {
                    derived: 'bg-secondary-subtle text-secondary-emphasis',
                    here: 'bg-primary-subtle text-primary-emphasis',
                    renter: 'bg-warning-subtle text-warning-emphasis',
                    offsite: 'bg-info-subtle text-info-emphasis',
                } %}
                <span class="badge {{ kind_class[milestone.kind.value] }}">{{ milestone.kind.label }}</span>
            {% endif %}
        </div>

        {% if milestone.warning and state != 'na' %}
            <p class="small text-warning-emphasis mb-1" data-hold-warning>
                <i class="bi bi-exclamation-triangle me-1" aria-hidden="true"></i>{{ milestone.warning }}
            </p>
        {% endif %}
        {% if (state == 'todo' or (milestone.isState and state != 'na')) and milestone.explanation %}
            <p class="text-body-secondary small mb-1">{{ milestone.explanation }}</p>
        {% endif %}
        {% if milestone.detail and state != 'na' %}
            <p class="small mb-1"><i class="bi bi-clipboard-data me-1" aria-hidden="true"></i>{{ milestone.detail }}</p>
        {% endif %}

        {#
          A step offers only the WAY to where it is done — a page, a box.
          Every status decision lives in the journey's heading, the proposed
          one and the others behind it, and nowhere else: one page offering
          « Clôturer la location » twice is a page where pressing either is
          a guess about which one counts. The step heading the journey has
          its way up there already.
        #}
        {% if state == 'todo' and not future and milestone.kind.value == 'here' and not is_next
            and milestone.action and (milestone.action.box or milestone.action.command)
            and milestone.action.command != 'countersign' %}
            <div class="mt-2">
                {% include '@rental/management/_milestone_action.html.twig' with {
                    action: milestone.action, small: true,
                    asset: asset, booking: booking, booking_url: booking_url, renter_decisions: renter_decisions,
                    contract_step: contract_step,
                } only %}
            </div>
        {% endif %}

        {% if milestone.key == 'contract_generated' and not future and state != 'na' %}
            {% include '@rental/management/_contract_step.html.twig' with {
                contract_step: contract_step, asset: asset, booking: booking, state: state,
            } only %}
        {% endif %}
        {% if milestone.key == 'contract_countersigned' and not future and state != 'na' %}
            {% include '@rental/management/_countersign_step.html.twig' with {
                contract_step: contract_step, asset: asset, booking: booking, booking_url: booking_url,
            } only %}
        {% endif %}

    </div>
</li>
{% endfor %}
</ol>
